- to easily send RabbitMQ Messages;

you should write a json string like below:
{
    "routing-key":"Data_Sleep",
    "msg":[
        "01234567890",
        "01234567890",
        "01234567890"
    ],
    "time-cell":1
}

- routing-key: routing-key
- msg: message array
- time-cell: The interval between sending msg array data, the unit is seconds
